row("B1a$'$, overall", "agreement on schedule-affected pairs $\\ge$0.90 and the model beats every time-resolved baseline (paired CI of baseline $-$ model $>0$)",
    f"{f(TM['agree']['model'])} ({n(TM['pairs'])} pairs); on all {n(B5['pairs'])} pairs where truth or any predictor changes: {f(B5['agree']['model'])}",
    f"stage$_1$ (earlier model): {f(TM['agree']['stage_v1'])} (all pairs: {f(B5['agree']['stage_v1'])}, margin {ci(ci_['stage_v1'], 4)}); capture-static: {f(TM['agree']['capture_static'])}; static-now: {f(TM['agree']['static_now'])}",
